  id: Forest_Cabin_5
  headerName: "House Notes \u2014 5"
  content: "\tI can see it. The land below is eroding, crumbling away into nothing.
    Is that what's causing the earthquakes?\n\r\n\tIs the sky always this close?
    My head is spinning in a way I don't recognize.\n\r\n\tThe broadcasts say to
    go high. To get above whatever is swallowing the ground. Someone up there will
    explain it, I suppose."
